{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FERAL BLOOD DOLL - Psycho Bad Girl CRPG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonlinear, interaction-rich RPG gameplay in an alternate-history present-day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/999260ab43294d8939d588191a4645e3.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/999260ab43294d8939d588191a4645e3.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/999260ab43294d8939d588191a4645e3.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced turn-based combat where you eat cops, puke on feds, summon your gfs in battle and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/403bd7b2f68a0e34bcf57c739c2ff0af.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/403bd7b2f68a0e34bcf57c739c2ff0af.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/403bd7b2f68a0e34bcf57c739c2ff0af.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to raves. Flirt with the DJ. Get pierced. Drink blood. Learn to cook. Perform rituals. Sell drugs. Develop an insect fetish. Find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/b5b287dd6b761cac8abc74425b9cb9e9.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/b5b287dd6b761cac8abc74425b9cb9e9.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/b5b287dd6b761cac8abc74425b9cb9e9.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Present day. USA.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep underground, an aging megastructure hangs suspended over a bottomless abyss. Its towers stretch downward like an inverted city. People live here like rats in a ship. Police and federal agents secretly hunt and capture suspected psychics using predictive modeling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside your brain, a <i>child</i> is growing...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/f0f6d58bc0765c20e882ca7acb77a08a.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/f0f6d58bc0765c20e882ca7acb77a08a.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/f0f6d58bc0765c20e882ca7acb77a08a.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The state, the abyss, and your past are closing in around you on all sides. Become the FERAL BLOOD DOLL and escape the city \u2013 or be devoured by it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unrestrained Discovery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go anywhere and do anything from the moment the game begins. How you plan your run and reach the surface is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/b84ccc37b27e5290b5b83844fdd78a8c.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/b84ccc37b27e5290b5b83844fdd78a8c.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/b84ccc37b27e5290b5b83844fdd78a8c.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe that the best games let you organically discover their worlds and mechanics for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FERAL BLOOD DOLL gives you everything you need to learn its systems within the actual game, but it\u2019s up to you to uncover it. No patronizing hand-holding or clumsy tutorializing.\u00a0There are always multiple ways to progress. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cali-Jank is Back!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction-driven gameplay with by a simple mouse interface and lots of yummy stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/3c06514bb4548e414876c55a999c3fb9.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/3c06514bb4548e414876c55a999c3fb9.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/3c06514bb4548e414876c55a999c3fb9.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different characters solve problems in different ways. Your skills and traits can open up entire new mechanics and playstyle options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/f49b5f01940bf8b5f92fc3d215c4fae2.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/f49b5f01940bf8b5f92fc3d215c4fae2.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/f49b5f01940bf8b5f92fc3d215c4fae2.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Romance\u2019 mastery allows you to date NPCs and summon them in battle as a date.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Crime\u2019 mastery allows you to smash windows and cut padlocks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Blood Kink\u2019 mastery allows you to drink blood for a tactical boost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Psychonautica\u2019 mastery allows you to take drugs with no inebriation penalty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Ritual\u2019 mastery allows you to make sacrifices at your home altar, taking you to strange otherplaces where you can make forbidden contracts with Entities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Restraint Kink\u2019 mastery turns the \u2018restrained\u2019 status effect from an ailment to a perk \u2013 useful for tackling certain areas and bosses early.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>... and many more.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/5781cd3b26c8e428a6fe3546dfa262ea.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/5781cd3b26c8e428a6fe3546dfa262ea.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/5781cd3b26c8e428a6fe3546dfa262ea.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fluid Turn-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative, seamless turn-based combat system with strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/7403cbcf20321735179014c145ff948a.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/7403cbcf20321735179014c145ff948a.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/7403cbcf20321735179014c145ff948a.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enemies directly on the 3D field with chunky ATB-style battle mechanics. Reposition with full range of movement, and use your environment to get the upperhand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive fast paced battles with an arsenal of abilities, status effects, perks and synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/dd4d16e56b604a54ec155f6d8bdc72fe.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/dd4d16e56b604a54ec155f6d8bdc72fe.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/dd4d16e56b604a54ec155f6d8bdc72fe.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No random encounters, enemies actually exist in the world. Switch in and out of combat at any time \u2013 npcs will continue fighting while you walk around in realtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Class and Party Systems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and customize your twin personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine any two classes into a hybrid class, or pick a pure-class to trade versatility for unique pure-class skills. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/a3b7cf1a47d4812f2d91372be78d282f.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/a3b7cf1a47d4812f2d91372be78d282f.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/a3b7cf1a47d4812f2d91372be78d282f.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Gutter Slut</i>. Ferocious and street-level. She can use her Bite skill to eat cops alive, or Puke and Piss to attack at range.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Psychic Stoner</i>. Overly online and house-bound, she uses skills like Brain Rot and Mind Break to psychically damage her foes. Powerful, but she can use up all your drugs quickly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Heartless Bitch</i>. Cold and classy, she uses skills like Dominate and Seduce to control the field, alongside knife attacks with high melee damage and bleed-potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Chaos Girlthing</i>. Not fully human, her Infest skill lays eggs inside enemies, which hatch into her perfect insect daughters, killing their host.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Domestic Lesbian</i>. She enjoys cooking, gardening, and wishes she was in a cozy game. Her relationship skills make her an excellent support character \u2013 especially if you have a lot of girlfriends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Blood Witch</i>. The esoteric spooky lady. Her chaos magic becomes very powerful when enough blood has been spilled in the vicinity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fully-nonlinear world, your class choice can completely change the path of your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dating</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FERAL BLOOD DOLL takes a unique gameplay-oriented approach to RPG dating mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve asked someone out, you can call them on your phone at any time to summon them in combat. This will begin a date. Kill enemies and find treasure before the date timer runs out to get more romance points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/8635a2080bb5e491f4a99da003ab5bbe.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/8635a2080bb5e491f4a99da003ab5bbe.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/8635a2080bb5e491f4a99da003ab5bbe.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the date, you relationship will strengthen based on how well you did.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rank up your relationship, move in with your gf, and even get married (wives auto summon when your hp falls below 30%)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/989219ee25afceb811b0d33390e0dc4c.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/989219ee25afceb811b0d33390e0dc4c.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/989219ee25afceb811b0d33390e0dc4c.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many romanceable NPCs. The rave acts as the game\u2019s main \u201ctown\u201d, but you\u2019ll also discover other friendly locations. Go to a squat-house and get your tongue pierced. Or to a bdsm dungeon and have the domme teach you new abilities. Or stay home, summon a demon in your apartment, and flirt with her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/ef124e5a88d34a1f676d2f8edb37e318.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/ef124e5a88d34a1f676d2f8edb37e318.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/ef124e5a88d34a1f676d2f8edb37e318.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Poly-Dynamics skill can allow you to date multiple partners and even summon several at once for a group date. Yes, an all-wives run is possible if you are extremely clever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(pls note: this game does <u>NOT</u> include any NSFW/R18 content)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness a psychosocial thriller unlike any RPG before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/b524edaeeec9bee4f1971506e150ad58.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/b524edaeeec9bee4f1971506e150ad58.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/b524edaeeec9bee4f1971506e150ad58.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hyper-kinetic tale of survival, redemption and vengeance, where the city\u2019s dark origins are only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of misfits and villains converges on you. Who survives depends on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/8e378c6929207e2a8deca76dd666b70c.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/8e378c6929207e2a8deca76dd666b70c.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/8e378c6929207e2a8deca76dd666b70c.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WISHLIST FERAL BLOOD DOLL NOW!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4020690?t=1758752138","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/f4d6a6a038770244e00dd2f73da9b5d0547014d9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758752138","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/7adc9d16b250f934329dcc5607130fff3a14ac82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758752138","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/7adc9d16b250f934329dcc5607130fff3a14ac82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758752138","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"FERAL BLOOD DOLL contains animated violence, mild gore, use of drugs & alcohol, and references to sexuality and kink. \r\n\r\nAlthough there are clear sexual themes in the game's narrative and mechanics, this game does NOT contain any erotic material, nudity, or sex scenes. Nothing here was designed to titillate or arouse the viewer, It's simply a game for grown ups who already know that sex exists."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FERAL BLOOD DOLL - Psycho Bad Girl CRPG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonlinear, interaction-rich RPG gameplay in an alternate-history present-day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/999260ab43294d8939d588191a4645e3.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/999260ab43294d8939d588191a4645e3.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/999260ab43294d8939d588191a4645e3.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced turn-based combat where you eat cops, puke on feds, summon your gfs in battle and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/403bd7b2f68a0e34bcf57c739c2ff0af.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/403bd7b2f68a0e34bcf57c739c2ff0af.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/403bd7b2f68a0e34bcf57c739c2ff0af.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to raves. Flirt with the DJ. Get pierced. Drink blood. Learn to cook. Perform rituals. Sell drugs. Develop an insect fetish. Find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/b5b287dd6b761cac8abc74425b9cb9e9.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/b5b287dd6b761cac8abc74425b9cb9e9.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/b5b287dd6b761cac8abc74425b9cb9e9.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Present day. USA.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep underground, an aging megastructure hangs suspended over a bottomless abyss. Its towers stretch downward like an inverted city. People live here like rats in a ship. Police and federal agents secretly hunt and capture suspected psychics using predictive modeling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside your brain, a <i>child</i> is growing...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/f0f6d58bc0765c20e882ca7acb77a08a.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/f0f6d58bc0765c20e882ca7acb77a08a.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/f0f6d58bc0765c20e882ca7acb77a08a.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The state, the abyss, and your past are closing in around you on all sides. Become the FERAL BLOOD DOLL and escape the city \u2013 or be devoured by it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unrestrained Discovery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go anywhere and do anything from the moment the game begins. How you plan your run and reach the surface is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/b84ccc37b27e5290b5b83844fdd78a8c.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/b84ccc37b27e5290b5b83844fdd78a8c.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/b84ccc37b27e5290b5b83844fdd78a8c.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe that the best games let you organically discover their worlds and mechanics for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FERAL BLOOD DOLL gives you everything you need to learn its systems within the actual game, but it\u2019s up to you to uncover it. No patronizing hand-holding or clumsy tutorializing.\u00a0There are always multiple ways to progress. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cali-Jank is Back!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction-driven gameplay with by a simple mouse interface and lots of yummy stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/3c06514bb4548e414876c55a999c3fb9.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/3c06514bb4548e414876c55a999c3fb9.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/3c06514bb4548e414876c55a999c3fb9.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different characters solve problems in different ways. Your skills and traits can open up entire new mechanics and playstyle options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/f49b5f01940bf8b5f92fc3d215c4fae2.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/f49b5f01940bf8b5f92fc3d215c4fae2.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/f49b5f01940bf8b5f92fc3d215c4fae2.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Romance\u2019 mastery allows you to date NPCs and summon them in battle as a date.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Crime\u2019 mastery allows you to smash windows and cut padlocks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Blood Kink\u2019 mastery allows you to drink blood for a tactical boost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Psychonautica\u2019 mastery allows you to take drugs with no inebriation penalty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Ritual\u2019 mastery allows you to make sacrifices at your home altar, taking you to strange otherplaces where you can make forbidden contracts with Entities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Restraint Kink\u2019 mastery turns the \u2018restrained\u2019 status effect from an ailment to a perk \u2013 useful for tackling certain areas and bosses early.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>... and many more.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/5781cd3b26c8e428a6fe3546dfa262ea.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/5781cd3b26c8e428a6fe3546dfa262ea.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/5781cd3b26c8e428a6fe3546dfa262ea.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fluid Turn-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative, seamless turn-based combat system with strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/7403cbcf20321735179014c145ff948a.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/7403cbcf20321735179014c145ff948a.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/7403cbcf20321735179014c145ff948a.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enemies directly on the 3D field with chunky ATB-style battle mechanics. Reposition with full range of movement, and use your environment to get the upperhand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive fast paced battles with an arsenal of abilities, status effects, perks and synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/dd4d16e56b604a54ec155f6d8bdc72fe.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/dd4d16e56b604a54ec155f6d8bdc72fe.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/dd4d16e56b604a54ec155f6d8bdc72fe.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No random encounters, enemies actually exist in the world. Switch in and out of combat at any time \u2013 npcs will continue fighting while you walk around in realtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Class and Party Systems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and customize your twin personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine any two classes into a hybrid class, or pick a pure-class to trade versatility for unique pure-class skills. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/a3b7cf1a47d4812f2d91372be78d282f.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/a3b7cf1a47d4812f2d91372be78d282f.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/a3b7cf1a47d4812f2d91372be78d282f.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Gutter Slut</i>. Ferocious and street-level. She can use her Bite skill to eat cops alive, or Puke and Piss to attack at range.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Psychic Stoner</i>. Overly online and house-bound, she uses skills like Brain Rot and Mind Break to psychically damage her foes. Powerful, but she can use up all your drugs quickly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Heartless Bitch</i>. Cold and classy, she uses skills like Dominate and Seduce to control the field, alongside knife attacks with high melee damage and bleed-potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Chaos Girlthing</i>. Not fully human, her Infest skill lays eggs inside enemies, which hatch into her perfect insect daughters, killing their host.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Domestic Lesbian</i>. She enjoys cooking, gardening, and wishes she was in a cozy game. Her relationship skills make her an excellent support character \u2013 especially if you have a lot of girlfriends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Blood Witch</i>. The esoteric spooky lady. Her chaos magic becomes very powerful when enough blood has been spilled in the vicinity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fully-nonlinear world, your class choice can completely change the path of your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dating</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FERAL BLOOD DOLL takes a unique gameplay-oriented approach to RPG dating mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve asked someone out, you can call them on your phone at any time to summon them in combat. This will begin a date. Kill enemies and find treasure before the date timer runs out to get more romance points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/8635a2080bb5e491f4a99da003ab5bbe.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/8635a2080bb5e491f4a99da003ab5bbe.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/8635a2080bb5e491f4a99da003ab5bbe.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the date, you relationship will strengthen based on how well you did.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rank up your relationship, move in with your gf, and even get married (wives auto summon when your hp falls below 30%)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/989219ee25afceb811b0d33390e0dc4c.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/989219ee25afceb811b0d33390e0dc4c.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/989219ee25afceb811b0d33390e0dc4c.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many romanceable NPCs. The rave acts as the game\u2019s main \u201ctown\u201d, but you\u2019ll also discover other friendly locations. Go to a squat-house and get your tongue pierced. Or to a bdsm dungeon and have the domme teach you new abilities. Or stay home, summon a demon in your apartment, and flirt with her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/ef124e5a88d34a1f676d2f8edb37e318.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/ef124e5a88d34a1f676d2f8edb37e318.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/ef124e5a88d34a1f676d2f8edb37e318.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Poly-Dynamics skill can allow you to date multiple partners and even summon several at once for a group date. Yes, an all-wives run is possible if you are extremely clever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(pls note: this game does <u>NOT</u> include any NSFW/R18 content)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness a psychosocial thriller unlike any RPG before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/b524edaeeec9bee4f1971506e150ad58.poster.avif?t=1758752138\" width=300 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/b524edaeeec9bee4f1971506e150ad58.webm?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020690/extras/b524edaeeec9bee4f1971506e150ad58.mp4?t=1758752138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hyper-kinetic tale of survival, redemption and vengeance, where 